      ${u ? `<div class="kpi"><div><small>Último período (${mesTxt(u.mes)})</small><b>${num(u.consumoKwh)} kWh</b><span class="${vK > 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}" style="font-size:12px">${a ? pct(vK) + ' vs mes anterior' : ''}</span></div><div><small>Total pagado</small><b>${pesos(u.total)}</b><span class="${vT > 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}" style="font-size:12px">${a ? pct(vT) : ''}</span></div><div><small>Precio medio</small><b>${precioKwh(u) ? '$' + num(precioKwh(u), 1) : '–'}/kWh</b><span class="${vP > 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}" style="font-size:12px">${a ? pct(vP) : ''}</span></div>${u.demandaMaxKw != null ? `<div><small>Demanda máx.</small><b>${num(u.demandaMaxKw, 1)} kW</b></div>` : ''}</div>
      <div>${chipNivel(ch)}</div>${barras(ult12.map(x => mesTxt(x.mes)), [{ nombre: 'kWh', color: '#2D7D46', valores: ult12.map(x => x.consumoKwh) }], v => num(v))}`
